# Bloodmoon "A Blocked Door" won by the fistfight Falco allows; raven_rock's 1010 takes the other path (Hroldar dies).
# Each bare-fisted punch takes the player's UnarmedDamage from Hroldar's Stamina and pauses his regeneration; at
# fatigue 150 he greets once, at 50 he gives up (50), Falco rewards the player (70) and Carnius closes it (90).
# No --fast: Stamina regenerates in game time, and --fast puts about 16 game seconds between punches.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_co_mine --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/morrowind_runtime.md#brawls

case co_brawl
run
player->PositionCell -450 -142 330 0 "Raven Rock, Vacant House"
activate 0676D5A3
sleep 24
activate 0676D5A3
sleep 24
activate 0676D5A3
sleep 24
activate 0676D5A3
sleep 24
until 600 ColonyState == 2
run
player->PositionCell 3504 4553 16407 0 "Fort Frostmoth, Imperial Cult Shrine"
until 600 "Carnius Magius"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Carnius Magius
ask assignment
expect GetJournalIndex CO_2 == 10
bye
run
player->Position -197200 160250 870 0
until 600 "Falco Galenus"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Falco Galenus
ask assignment
ask get rid of him
expect GetJournalIndex CO_2 == 20
bye
run
player->Position -198100 160900 975 0
until 600 "Hroldar the Strange"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Hroldar the Strange
expect GetJournalIndex CO_2 == 30
run
player->Position -197200 160250 870 0
until 600 "Falco Galenus"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Falco Galenus
ask get rid of him
expect GetJournalIndex CO_2 == 40
bye
end

# Run this one without --fast: Stamina regenerates in game time, and --fast puts ~16 game seconds between punches.
case co_brawl_fight
console tgm
run
player->Position -198100 160900 975 0
until 600 "Hroldar the Strange"->GetDistance player < 400
punch 150 Hroldar the Strange
expect "Hroldar the Strange"->GetFatigue <= 150
expect "Hroldar the Strange"->GetHealth > 0
bye
punch 150 Hroldar the Strange
until 300 GetJournalIndex CO_2 == 50
expect "Hroldar the Strange"->GetFatigue <= 50
bye
end

case co_brawl_reward
run
player->Position -197200 160250 870 0
until 600 "Falco Galenus"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Falco Galenus
ask get rid of him
expect GetJournalIndex CO_2 == 70
bye
run
player->PositionCell 3504 4553 16407 0 "Fort Frostmoth, Imperial Cult Shrine"
until 600 "Carnius Magius"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Carnius Magius
ask assignment
expect GetJournalIndex CO_2 == 90
bye
end
